INFO:root:LOOT does not support message highlighting equivalent to mlox's blue highlighting, the following message will be treated as not highlighted: "Casey Tucker's "NPC Functionality" alters the distance your PC needs to be from an NPC before the NPC greets you. In vanilla Morrowind this value is 6 (if the Construction Set help is to be believed this is multiplied by the NPC's Hello rating to get the distance before they talk)
LadyDeadlock's "Reduced (Passing) Commentary Mod" and "No Greet" both decrease this value (to 3 an 0 respectively). mlox will load "Reduced (Passing) Commentary Mod" or "No Greet" after Casey Tucker's "NPC Functionality" mod so the reduced greeting distance is used. If you wish to use the higher greeting distance of "NPC Functionality" then remove either "Reduced (Passing) Commentary Mod" or "No Greet"."
