INFO:root:LOOT does not support message highlighting equivalent to mlox's blue highlighting, the following message will be treated as not highlighted: ""Vurt's Leafy West Gash" is available in two versions, the original "Vurt's Leafy West Gash" and "Vurt's Leafy West Gash II". The latter has less colourful trees than the original mod.
